# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout, regardless
# of a contributor's local `core.autocrlf` setting. Without this file, Git
# for Windows' common `core.autocrlf=true` default silently checks out every
# text file (including .go, .sh, Makefile) as CRLF, which makes `gofmt -l .`
# flag every single file and can break shell scripts under Git Bash.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never normalize genuinely binary content.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
